    {
      "name": "write_requirements",
      "args": {
        "content": "# Requirements \u2014 Unread Notifications Home Page Card\n\n- **Run ID:** `20261104-093718-feature-new-home-unread-notifs`\n- **Mode:** `brownfield`\n- **Intent:** `feature-new`\n\n---\n\n## In scope\n\n1. **Unread notifications card component (`plugins/notifications/src/components/UnreadNotificationsCard/**`)**: Build a new home page card component that fetches the signed-in user's latest unread notifications via `NotificationsApi` (`read: false`, sorted by newest with a bounded limit), renders each unread item with a deep link to `/notifications?id=<id>`, provides a per-item mark-as-read action via `updateNotifications({ ids: [id], read: true })`, refreshes live when a signal arrives on the `notifications` channel via `useSignal('notifications')`, falls back to periodic polling when `isSignalsAvailable` is `false`, and cleans up all subscriptions and timers on unmount.\n2. **New frontend system home page widget registration (`plugins/notifications/src/alpha.tsx`, `plugins/notifications/package.json`)**: Add `@backstage/plugin-home-react` as a dependency of `@backstage/plugin-notifications` and register the unread notifications card as a `HomePageWidgetBlueprint` extension on the `notifications` frontend plugin in `plugins/notifications/src/alpha.tsx`.\n3. **Internationalization strings (`plugins/notifications/src/translation.ts`)**: Add user-facing translation strings for the unread notifications card to `notificationsTranslationRef` in `plugins/notifications/src/translation.ts`.\n4. **Notification deep-link handling and row highlighting (`plugins/notifications/src/components/NotificationsPage/NotificationsPage.tsx`, `plugins/notifications/src/components/NotificationsTable/NotificationsTable.tsx`, `plugins/notifications/src/components/NotificationsTable/NotificationsTable.module.css`)**: Read the `?id=<notificationId>` query parameter in `NotificationsPage.tsx`, ensure the targeted notification is visible and passed to `NotificationsTable.tsx`, and apply a distinct highlighted-row"
      },
      "canonical_path": null,
      "args_clipped": true
    }
  ],
  "text": "`requirements.md` has been generated and accepted at `.sdlc/runs/20261104-093718-feature-new-home-unread-notifs/requirements.md`.\n\n### Summary of Contents\n- **In scope (1\u20137)**: Testable items covering `UnreadNotificationsCard`, new-frontend-system widget registration (`HomePageWidgetBlueprint`), translations, `?id=` deep-link row highlighting in `NotificationsPage`/`NotificationsTable`, app-context-free `CardExtension` rendering in `@backstage/plugin-home-react`, jsdom unit tests, docs, API reports, and changesets.\n- **Out of scope (1\u20135)**: Non-goals from the brief, including backend/storage/endpoint changes, old-frontend-system card extension exports, `app-config.yaml`/example-app changes, sibling package modifications, and off-limits paths.\n- **Functional requirements (FR-1 to FR-7)**: Grouped by `plugins/notifications` (FR-1 through FR-6) and `plugins/home-react` (FR-7).\n- **Non-functional requirements (NFR-1 to NFR-7)**: Repository rules covering 2026 Apache 2.0 headers, package style consistency, `screen` + `findBy*` testing rules without test IDs, hand-written per-package `patch` changesets without internal symbols, doc style guide compliance, API report regeneration commands, and forbidden commands.\n- **PII inventory & Role matrix**: Data sensitivity/protection table and role \u00d7 resource \u00d7 action authorization matrix.\n- **Acceptance criteria (AC-1 to AC-9)**: Executable criteria covering jsdom tests, unmount cleanup, `?id=` deep-link highlighting, `home-react` rendering without app context, API report checks, and the Gate 0 verification command.\n- **Open questions for HITL (1\u20134)**: Default card item limit, polling interval, empty-state presentation, and deep-link filter behavior.",
